"Blending_modes_Behind_Sample_image_with_dots.png"

#: ../../reference_manual/blending_modes/mix.rst:114
msgid "Left: **Normal**. Right: **Behind**."
msgstr "Esquerra: **Normal**. Dreta: **Darrere**."

#: ../../reference_manual/blending_modes/mix.rst:116
msgid "Erase (Blending Mode)"
msgstr "Esborra (mode de barreja)"

#: ../../reference_manual/blending_modes/mix.rst:120
msgid "Erase"
msgstr "Esborra"

# skip-rule: kct-erase
#: ../../reference_manual/blending_modes/mix.rst:124
msgid "This blending mode is called \"Erase\" in English."
msgstr "Aquest mode de barreja en anglès s'anomena «Erase»."

#: ../../reference_manual/blending_modes/mix.rst:126
msgid ""
"This subtracts the opaque pixels of the upper layer from the lower layer, "
"effectively erasing."
msgstr ""
"Això sostreu els píxels opacs de la capa superior des de la capa inferior, "
"esborrant-los de manera efectiva."

#: ../../reference_manual/blending_modes/mix.rst:131
msgid ""
".. image:: /images/blending_modes/mix/"
"Blending_modes_Erase_Sample_image_with_dots.png"
msgstr ""
".. image:: /images/blending_modes/mix/"
"Blending_modes_Erase_Sample_image_with_dots.png"

#: ../../reference_manual/blending_modes/mix.rst:131
msgid "Left: **Normal**. Right: **Erase**."
msgstr "Esquerra: **Normal**. Dreta: **Esborra**."

#: ../../reference_manual/blending_modes/mix.rst:133
#: ../../reference_manual/blending_modes/mix.rst:137
msgid "Geometric Mean"
msgstr "Mitjana geomètrica"

#: ../../reference_manual/blending_modes/mix.rst:141
msgid "This blending mode is called \"Geometric Mean\" in English."
msgstr "Aquest mode de barreja en anglès s'anomena «Geometric Mean»."

#: ../../reference_manual/blending_modes/mix.rst:143
msgid ""
"This blending mode multiplies the top layer with the bottom, and then "
"outputs the square root of that."
msgstr ""
"Aquest mode de barreja multiplica la capa superior amb la inferior i després "
"genera l'arrel quadrada."

#: ../../reference_manual/blending_modes/mix.rst:148
msgid ""
".. image:: /images/blending_modes/mix/"
"Blending_modes_Geometric_Mean_Sample_image_with_dots.png"
msgstr ""
".. image:: /images/blending_modes/mix/"
"Blending_modes_Geometric_Mean_Sample_image_with_dots.png"

#: ../../reference_manual/blending_modes/mix.rst:148
msgid "Left: **Normal**. Right: **Geometric Mean**."
msgstr "Esquerra: **Normal**. Dreta: **Mitjana geomètrica**."

#: ../../reference_manual/blending_modes/mix.rst:150
#: ../../reference_manual/blending_modes/mix.rst:154
msgid "Grain Extract"
msgstr "Extracció de gra"

#: ../../reference_manual/blending_modes/mix.rst:158
msgid "This blending mode is called \"Grain Extract\" in English."
msgstr "Aquest mode de barreja en anglès s'anomena «Grain Extract»."

#: ../../reference_manual/blending_modes/mix.rst:160
msgid ""
"Similar to Subtract, the colors of the upper layer are subtracted from the "
"colors of the lower layer, and then 50% gray is added."
msgstr ""
"Similar a Sostreu, els colors de la capa superior es restaran dels colors "
"des de la capa inferior i després s'hi afegirà un 50% de gris."

#: ../../reference_manual/blending_modes/mix.rst:165
msgid ""
".. image:: /images/blending_modes/mix/"
"Blending_modes_Grain_Extract_Sample_image_with_dots.png"
msgstr ""
".. image:: /images/blending_modes/mix/"
"Blending_modes_Grain_Extract_Sample_image_with_dots.png"

#: ../../reference_manual/blending_modes/mix.rst:165
msgid "Left: **Normal**. Right: **Grain Extract**."
msgstr "Esquerra: **Normal**. Dreta: **Extracció de gra**."

#: ../../reference_manual/blending_modes/mix.rst:167
#: ../../reference_manual/blending_modes/mix.rst:171
msgid "Grain Merge"
msgstr "Fusió de gra"

#: ../../reference_manual/blending_modes/mix.rst:175
msgid "This blending mode is called \"Grain Merge\" in English."
msgstr "Aquest mode de barreja en anglès s'anomena «Grain Merge»."

#: ../../reference_manual/blending_modes/mix.rst:177
msgid ""
"Similar to Addition, the colors of the upper layer are added to the colors, "
"and then 50% gray is subtracted."
msgstr ""
"Similar a l'Addició, els colors de la capa superior s'afegiran als colors de "
"la capa inferior, i després s'hi restarà un 50% de gris."

#: ../../reference_manual/blending_modes/mix.rst:182
msgid ""
".. image:: /images/blending_modes/mix/"
"Blending_modes_Grain_Merge_Sample_image_with_dots.png"
msgstr ""
".. image:: /images/blending_modes/mix/"
"Blending_modes_Grain_Merge_Sample_image_with_dots.png"

#: ../../reference_manual/blending_modes/mix.rst:182
msgid "Left: **Normal**. Right: **Grain Merge**."
msgstr "Esquerra: **Normal**. Dreta: **Fusió de gra**."

#: ../../reference_manual/blending_modes/mix.rst:184
msgid "Greater (Blending Mode)"
msgstr "Engrandeix (mode de barreja)"

#: ../../reference_manual/blending_modes/mix.rst:188
msgid "Greater"
msgstr "Engrandeix"

#: ../../reference_manual/blending_modes/mix.rst:192
msgid "This blending mode is called \"Greater\" in English."
msgstr "Aquest mode de barreja en anglès s'anomena «Greater»."

#: ../../reference_manual/blending_modes/mix.rst:194
msgid ""
"A blending mode which checks whether the painted color is painted with a "
"higher opacity than the existing colors. If so, it paints over them, if not, "
"it doesn't paint at all."
msgstr ""
"Un mode de barreja que comprova si el color pintat està pintat amb una "
"opacitat més alta que els colors existents. Si és així, pinta sobre seu, si "
"no, no pinta res."

#: ../../reference_manual/blending_modes/mix.rst:196
msgid ""
"A similar mode is `Marker`_, which has the same behavior in regards to "
"opacity, but will always mix the colors."
msgstr ""
"Un mode similar és `Marcador`_, que té el mateix comportament pel que fa a "
"l'opacitat, però sempre mesclarà els colors."

#: ../../reference_manual/blending_modes/mix.rst:201
#: ../../reference_manual/blending_modes/mix.rst:205
msgid "Hard Mix"
msgstr "Mescla forta"

#: ../../reference_manual/blending_modes/mix.rst:209
msgid "This blending mode is called \"Hard Mix\" in English."
msgstr "Aquest mode de barreja en anglès s'anomena «Hard Mix»."

#: ../../reference_manual/blending_modes/mix.rst:211
msgid "Similar to Overlay."
msgstr "Similar a la Superposició."

#: ../../reference_manual/blending_modes/mix.rst:213
msgid ""
"Mixes both Color Dodge and Burn blending modes. If the color of the upper "
"layer is darker than 50%, the blending mode will be Burn, if not the "
"blending mode will be Color Dodge."
msgstr ""
"Mescla ambdós modes de barreja Esvaïment del color i Cremat del color. Si el "
"color de la capa superior és més fosc que el 50%, el mode de barreja serà "
"Cremat del color, d'altra manera el mode de barreja serà Esvaïment del color."

#: ../../reference_manual/blending_modes/mix.rst:219
msgid ""
".. image:: /images/blending_modes/mix/"
"Blending_modes_Hard_Mix_Sample_image_with_dots.png"
msgstr ""
".. image:: /images/blending_modes/mix/"
"Blending_modes_Hard_Mix_Sample_image_with_dots.png"

#: ../../reference_manual/blending_modes/mix.rst:219
msgid "Left: **Normal**. Right: **Hard Mix**."
msgstr "Esquerra: **Normal**. Dreta: **Mescla forta**."

#: ../../reference_manual/blending_modes/mix.rst:221
#: ../../reference_manual/blending_modes/mix.rst:225
msgid "Hard Mix (Photoshop)"
msgstr "Mescla forta (Photoshop)"

#: ../../reference_manual/blending_modes/mix.rst:229
msgid "This blending mode is called \"Hard Mix (Photoshop)\" in English."
msgstr "Aquest mode de barreja en anglès s'anomena «Hard Mix (Photoshop)»."

#: ../../reference_manual/blending_modes/mix.rst:231
msgid "This is the Hard Mix blending mode as it is implemented in Photoshop."
msgstr ""
"Aquest és el mode de barreja Mescla forta tal com està implementat en el "
"Photoshop."

#: ../../reference_manual/blending_modes/mix.rst:237
msgid ".. image:: /images/blending_modes/mix/Krita_4_0_hard_mix_ps.png"
msgstr ".. image:: /images/blending_modes/mix/Krita_4_0_hard_mix_ps.png"

#: ../../reference_manual/blending_modes/mix.rst:237
msgid ""
"**Left**: Dots are mixed in with the normal blending mode, on the **Right**: "
"Dots are mixed in with hardmix."
msgstr ""
"**Esquerra**: Els punts es mesclen amb el mode de barreja Normal. **Dreta**: "
"Els punts es mesclen amb la Mescla forta."

#: ../../reference_manual/blending_modes/mix.rst:239
msgid ""
"This add the two values, and then checks if the value is above the maximum. "
"If so it will output the maximum, otherwise the minimum."
msgstr ""
"Això afegeix els dos valors i després verifica si el valor està per sobre "
"del màxim. Si és així emetrà el màxim, en cas contrari el mínim."

#: ../../reference_manual/blending_modes/mix.rst:244
msgid "Hard Mix HDR"
msgstr "Mescla forta HDR"

#: ../../reference_manual/blending_modes/mix.rst:246
msgid "Special variant of :guilabel:`Hard Mix` for floating point spaces."
msgstr ""
"Variant especial del :guilabel:`Mescla forta` per a espais de coma flotant."

#: ../../reference_manual/blending_modes/mix.rst:248
#: ../../reference_manual/blending_modes/mix.rst:252
msgid "Hard Mix Softer (Photoshop)"
msgstr "Mescla forta més suau (Photoshop)"

#: ../../reference_manual/blending_modes/mix.rst:256
msgid ""
"This blending mode is called \"Hard Mix Softer (Photoshop)\" in English."
msgstr ""
"Aquest mode de barreja en anglès s'anomena «Hard Mix Softer (Photoshop)»."

#: ../../reference_manual/blending_modes/mix.rst:260
msgid ""
"This is the Hard Mix blending mode as it is implemented in Photoshop for "
"texturing brushes. It produces softer edges than the normal *Hard Mix "
"(Photoshop)*."
msgstr ""
"Aquest és el mode de barreja Mescla forta tal com està implementat en el "
"Photoshop per als pinzells amb textura. Produeix vores més suaus que la "
"*Mescla forta (Photoshop)* normal."

#: ../../reference_manual/blending_modes/mix.rst:267
msgid ""
".. image:: /images/blending_modes/mix/"
"Blending_modes_Hard_Mix_Softer_Photoshop_Sample_image_with_dots.png"
msgstr ""
".. image:: /images/blending_modes/mix/"
"Blending_modes_Hard_Mix_Softer_Photoshop_Sample_image_with_dots.png"

#: ../../reference_manual/blending_modes/mix.rst:267
msgid ""
"**Left**: Dots are mixed in with the normal blending mode, on the **Right**: "
"Dots are mixed in with hard mix softer."
msgstr ""
"**Esquerra**: Els punts es mesclen amb el mode de barreja Normal. **Dreta**: "
"Els punts es mesclen amb la Mescla forta més suau."

#: ../../reference_manual/blending_modes/mix.rst:269
msgid ""
"This is like the Inverse Subtract mode but the two terms are scaled up to "
"increase the contrast. This is not really a Hard Mix mode in the sense that "
"it doesn't choose between a result or another based on a threshold, although "
"in most cases the result looks like the normal *Hard Mix (Photoshop)* but "
"with softer edges."
msgstr ""
"És com el mode Resta inversa, però s'escalen els dos termes per a fer "
"augmentar el contrast. Aquest no és realment un mode de Mescla forta en el "
"sentit que no es tria entre un resultat o un altre en funció d'un llindar, "
"encara que en la majoria dels casos, el resultat es veu com la *Mescla forta "
"(Photoshop)* normal però amb vores més suaus."

#: ../../reference_manual/blending_modes/mix.rst:273
#: ../../reference_manual/blending_modes/mix.rst:277
#: ../../reference_manual/blending_modes/mix.rst:299
msgid "Hard Overlay"
msgstr "Superposició forta"

#: ../../reference_manual/blending_modes/mix.rst:281
msgid "This blending mode is called \"Hard Overlay\" in English."
msgstr "Aquest mode de barreja en anglès s'anomena «Hard Overlay»."

#: ../../reference_manual/blending_modes/mix.rst:285
msgid ""
"Similar to Hard Light but Hard Light use Screen when the value is above 50%. "
"Divide gives better results than Screen, especially on floating point images."
msgstr ""
"Similar a la Llum forta -la qual fa servir Pantalla quan el valor està per "
"sobre del 50%-. Dividir dona millors resultats que Pantalla, especialment en "
"imatges amb coma flotant."

#: ../../reference_manual/blending_modes/mix.rst:290
msgid ""
".. image:: /images/blending_modes/mix/"
"Blending_modes_Hard_Overlay_Sample_image_with_dots.png"
msgstr ""
".. image:: /images/blending_modes/mix/"
"Blending_modes_Hard_Overlay_Sample_image_with_dots.png"

#: ../../reference_manual/blending_modes/mix.rst:290
msgid "Left: **Normal**. Right: **Hard Overlay**."
msgstr "Esquerra: **Normal**. Dreta: **Superposició forta**."

#: ../../reference_manual/blending_modes/mix.rst:295
msgid "Hard Overlay HDR"
msgstr "Superposició forta HDR"

#: ../../reference_manual/blending_modes/mix.rst:297
msgid "Special variant of :guilabel:`Hard Overlay` for floating point spaces."
msgstr ""
"Variant especial de :guilabel:`Superposició forta` per a espais de coma "
"flotant."

#: ../../reference_manual/blending_modes/mix.rst:301
#: ../../reference_manual/blending_modes/mix.rst:305
msgid "Marker"
msgstr "Marcador"

#: ../../reference_manual/blending_modes/mix.rst:309
msgid "This blending mode is called \"Marker\" in English."
msgstr "Aquest mode de barreja en anglès s'anomena «Marker»."

#: ../../reference_manual/blending_modes/mix.rst:313
msgid ""
"Marker is similar to `Alpha Darken`_, but adheres to alpha lock/inherit "
"alpha and interpolates between colors cleanly. It's most useful when you use "
"it on a brush in \"Build-Up\" mode painting mode, wheere it will only "
"increase the opacity on your layer if the opacity of your stroke is higher "
"and mixes the colors, like the marker tool in Paint Tool SAI."
msgstr ""
"El marcador és similar a `Enfosquiment alfa`_, però s'adhereix al bloqueig "
"alfa/hereta l'alfa i interpola entre colors netament. És més útil quan "
"l'utilitzeu en un pinzell en el mode de pintura «Construcció», ja que només "
"augmentarà l'opacitat de la capa si l'opacitat del traç és més alta i mescla "
"els colors, com l'eina de marcadors en el Paint Tool SAI."

#: ../../reference_manual/blending_modes/mix.rst:317
msgid ""
"It's also conceptually similar to `Greater`_, which in turn only mixes the "
"colors if your stroke's opacity is higher."
msgstr ""
"També és conceptualment similar a `Engrandeix`_, que al seu torn només "
"mescla els colors si l'opacitat del traç és més alta."

#: ../../reference_manual/blending_modes/mix.rst:319
msgid ""
"The Opacity and Flow behavior is identical to `Alpha Darken`_, they only "
"affect the blending of the **alpha** channel, but the **color** channels are "
"blended as if they were set to 100%."
msgstr ""
"El comportament de l'Opacitat i el flux és idèntic a `Enfosquiment alfa`_, "
"només afecten la barreja del canal **alfa**, però els canals de **color** es "
"barregen com si estiguessin establerts al 100%."

#: ../../reference_manual/blending_modes/mix.rst:322
msgid "Normal (Blending Mode)"
msgstr "Normal (mode de barreja)"

#: ../../reference_manual/blending_modes/mix.rst:322
msgid "Source Over"
msgstr "Sobre l'origen"

#: ../../reference_manual/blending_modes/mix.rst:326
msgid "Normal"
msgstr "Normal"

#: ../../reference_manual/blending_modes/mix.rst:330
msgid "This blending mode is called \"Normal\" in English."
msgstr "Aquest mode de barreja en anglès s'anomena «Normal»."

#: ../../reference_manual/blending_modes/mix.rst:332
msgid ""
"As you may have guessed this is the default Blending mode for all layers."
msgstr ""
"Com haureu endevinat, aquest és el mode de barreja predeterminat per a totes "
"les capes."

#: ../../reference_manual/blending_modes/mix.rst:334
msgid ""
"In this mode, the computer checks on the upper layer how transparent a pixel "
"is, which color it is, and then mixes the color of the upper layer with the "
"lower layer proportional to the transparency."
msgstr ""
"En aquest mode, l'ordinador comprovarà com és de transparent el píxel a la "
"capa superior, quin és el color i després barrejarà el color de la capa "
"superior amb la capa inferior de manera proporcional a la transparència."

#: ../../reference_manual/blending_modes/mix.rst:339
msgid ""
".. image:: /images/blending_modes/mix/"
"Blending_modes_Normal_50_Opacity_Sample_image_with_dots.png"
msgstr ""
".. image:: /images/blending_modes/mix/"
"Blending_modes_Normal_50_Opacity_Sample_image_with_dots.png"

#: ../../reference_manual/blending_modes/mix.rst:339
msgid "Left: **Normal** 100% Opacity. Right: **Normal** 50% Opacity."
msgstr ""
"Esquerra: **Normal** 100% d'opacitat. Dreta: **Normal** 50% d'opacitat."

#: ../../reference_manual/blending_modes/mix.rst:341
msgid "Overlay (Blending Mode)"
msgstr "Superposició (mode de barreja)"

#: ../../reference_manual/blending_modes/mix.rst:345
msgid "Overlay"
msgstr "Superposició"

#: ../../reference_manual/blending_modes/mix.rst:349
msgid "This blending mode is called \"Overlay\" in English."
msgstr "Aquest mode de barreja en anglès s'anomena «Overlay»."

#: ../../reference_manual/blending_modes/mix.rst:351
msgid ""
"A combination of the Multiply and Screen blending modes, switching between "
"both at a middle-lightness."
msgstr ""
"Una combinació dels modes de barreja Multiplica i Pantalla, canviant entre "
"tots dos en una claredat mitjana."

#: ../../reference_manual/blending_modes/mix.rst:353
msgid ""
"Overlay checks if the color on the upper layer has a lightness above 0.5. If "
"so, the pixel is blended like in Screen mode, if not the pixel is blended "
"like in Multiply mode."
msgstr ""
"La Superposició comprovarà si el color de la capa superior té una claredat "
"superior al 0,5. Si és així, el píxel es barrejarà com en el mode Pantalla, "
"d'altra manera es barrejarà com en el mode Multiplica."

#: ../../reference_manual/blending_modes/mix.rst:355
msgid "This is useful for deepening shadows and highlights."
msgstr "Això és útil per a aprofundir en les ombres i les llums intenses."

#: ../../reference_manual/blending_modes/mix.rst:360
msgid ""
".. image:: /images/blending_modes/mix/"
"Blending_modes_Overlay_Sample_image_with_dots.png"
msgstr ""
".. image:: /images/blending_modes/mix/"
"Blending_modes_Overlay_Sample_image_with_dots.png"

#: ../../reference_manual/blending_modes/mix.rst:360
msgid "Left: **Normal**. Right: **Overlay**."
msgstr "Esquerra: **Normal**. Dreta: **Superposició**."

#: ../../reference_manual/blending_modes/mix.rst:362
#: ../../reference_manual/blending_modes/mix.rst:366
msgid "Parallel"
msgstr "Paral·lel"

#: ../../reference_manual/blending_modes/mix.rst:370
msgid "This blending mode is called \"Parallel\" in English."
msgstr "Aquest mode de barreja en anglès s'anomena «Parallel»."

#: ../../reference_manual/blending_modes/mix.rst:372
msgid ""
"This one first takes the percentage in decimals for both layers. It then "
"adds the two values. Divides 2 by the sum."
msgstr ""
"Aquest mode primer pren el percentatge en decimals per a ambdues capes. "
"Després afegirà els dos valors. Divideix 2 per la suma."

